    With a Helm of OA you can be either chaotic or lawful, depending
on the situation.  Actually, being neutual seems to be the least
useful.  Aside: I recommend zapping Fire Brand with a wand of cancellation
and dip it into a fountain to get Excalibur once you have gotten
Frost Brand from you god( assuming, of course, that you
don't have a handy long sword. )

